{"product_id":"fallen-trilogy-3-book-set-by-lauren-kate","title":"Fallen Trilogy (3 Book Set) by Lauren Kate","description":"\u003cp data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"180\"\u003eA love so forbidden, it defies Heaven itself. Step into the hauntingly beautiful world of Fallen by Lauren Kate — a gothic romance where angels, mortals, and cursed love collide.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"182\" data-end=\"484\"\u003eWhen Luce Price is sent to Sword \u0026amp; Cross reform school, she meets Daniel Grigori — mysterious, distant, and somehow heartbreakingly familiar. She doesn’t know it yet, but Daniel is a fallen angel, and their love has been cursed to repeat through centuries — doomed to end in tragedy, again and again.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"486\" data-end=\"721\"\u003eThis three-book set sweeps you through a saga of eternal love, celestial battles, and dark secrets buried deep in time. Every page drips with passion and suspense — perfect for fans of Twilight, Hush Hush, and The Mortal Instruments.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"723\" data-end=\"799\"\u003eDive into the story where love never dies… it just falls, again and again.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"801\" data-end=\"1107\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"\u003eBook Details:\u003cbr data-start=\"814\" data-end=\"817\"\u003eAuthor: Lauren Kate\u003cbr data-start=\"836\" data-end=\"839\"\u003eTitles Included: Fallen, Torment, Passion\u003cbr data-start=\"880\" data-end=\"883\"\u003eFormat: Paperback\u003cbr data-start=\"963\" data-end=\"966\"\u003eGenre: Young Adult, Fantasy, Romance\u003cbr data-start=\"1002\" data-end=\"1005\"\u003ePublisher: Corgi \/ Random House\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45838295105689,"sku":"12RA32323","price":60.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/71Dcd8T18_L._UF1000_1000_QL80.jpg?v=1761667871","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/fallen-trilogy-3-book-set-by-lauren-kate","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}